msgstr "O nama"

msgid "Welcome!"
msgstr "Dobrodošli!"

msgid ""
"This project started as a fun exercise: learning to tell dog breeds apart, remember their names and find out a little more about each one.<br>\n"
"            For convenience, the <strong>FCI (Fédération Cynologique Internationale)</strong> classification was taken as the base."
msgstr ""
"Ovaj projekat je nastao kao zabava: naučiti da se razlikuju rase pasa, zapamte njihova imena i sazna nešto više o svakoj.<br>\n"
"            Radi lakšeg snalaženja, kao osnova je uzeta klasifikacija <strong>FCI (Fédération Cynologique Internationale)</strong>."

msgid "What is FCI"
msgstr "Šta je FCI"

msgid "FCI — Fédération Cynologique Internationale (International Canine Federation) — the largest international federation of kennel clubs,<br>which defines official breed standards and group structures worldwide."
msgstr "FCI — Fédération Cynologique Internationale (Međunarodna kinološka federacija) — najveća međunarodna federacija kinoloških saveza<br>koja definiše zvanične standarde rasa i strukturu grupa širom sveta."

msgid "Founded on 22 May 1911, headquartered in Thuin, Belgium."
msgstr "Osnovana 22. maja 1911. godine, sa sedištem u Tenu (Thuin), Belgija."

msgid "98 member countries."
msgstr "98 zemalja članica."

msgid "Recognizes 356 breeds; each breed belongs to its country of origin, which writes its standard."
msgstr "Priznaje 356 rasa; svaka rasa pripada zemlji porekla, koja piše njen standard."

msgid "FCI publishes standards in 4 languages (en/fr/de/es)."
msgstr "FCI objavljuje standarde na 4 jezika (en/fr/de/es)."

msgid ""
"To provide a broader perspective, the catalog also incorporates data from other kennel organizations, as well as independent breed sources.<br>\n"
"            As a result, the database includes not only officially recognized breeds, but also less common and developing ones."
msgstr ""
"Da bi se dobila šira perspektiva, katalog obuhvata i podatke drugih kinoloških organizacija i nezavisnih izvora o rasama.<br>\n"
"            Kao rezultat, baza podataka uključuje ne samo zvanično priznate rase, već i manje poznate i one u razvoju."

msgid ""
"If a breed is missing, it may not yet be added or sufficient reference "
"material is still being collected."
msgstr ""
"Ako rasa nedostaje, možda još nije dodata ili se i dalje prikuplja dovoljno "
"referentnog materijala."

msgid "About classification"
msgstr "O klasifikaciji"

msgid "The catalog combines:"
msgstr "Katalog objedinjuje:"

msgid "officially recognized FCI breeds and groups"
msgstr "zvanično priznate FCI rase i grupe"

msgid "breeds recognized by other kennel clubs"
msgstr "rase koje priznaju drugi kinološki savezi"

msgid "rare or developing breeds not yet formally classified"
msgstr "retke ili rase u razvoju koje još nisu formalno klasifikovane"

msgid ""
"Breed classification may vary between kennel organizations.\n"
"            The same breed can be assigned to different groups depending on the standard used."
msgstr ""
"Klasifikacija rasa može da se razlikuje između kinoloških organizacija.\n"
"            Ista rasa može biti svrstana u različite grupe u zavisnosti od primenjenog standarda."

msgid "For official FCI standards, you can visit the"
msgstr "Zvanične FCI standarde možete pogledati na"

msgid "FCI website"
msgstr "FCI veb-sajtu"

