msgid ""
"We do not sell or rent personal data. Data is shared only with Google "
"(analytics, only with your consent) and with the hosting provider that runs "
"our server, or where required by law."
msgstr ""
"Ne prodajemo niti iznajmljujemo lične podatke. Podaci se dele samo sa "
"Google-om (analitika, samo uz vašu saglasnost) i sa hosting provajderom koji"
" upravlja našim serverom, ili kada to zahteva zakon."

msgid ""
"The Website’s data, including contact-form messages and the consent "
"register, is stored in the Website’s database on a server in Italy."
msgstr ""
"Podaci Veb-sajta, uključujući poruke iz kontakt obrasca i evidenciju "
"saglasnosti, čuvaju se u bazi podataka Veb-sajta na serveru u Italiji."

msgid ""
"Where data is transferred to Google LLC (based in the United States) for "
"analytics, the transfer relies on the EU-US Data Privacy Framework, under "
"which Google is certified, and on Google's Standard Contractual Clauses and "
"Data Processing Addendum."
msgstr ""
