"Državama) radi analitike, prenos se zasniva na okviru EU–SAD za zaštitu "
"podataka (Data Privacy Framework), u kojem je Google sertifikovan, kao i na "
"Googleovim standardnim ugovornim klauzulama i Dodatku o obradi podataka."

msgid ""
"Contact-form messages are kept for up to 12 months and then deleted. "
"Consent-register entries are deleted after 12 months. Google Analytics data "
"is kept for 2 months."
msgstr ""
